OL,3,AHarry and Meghan's media treatment
OL,4,Aechoes what happened to Diana, Earl
OL,5,ASpencer tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarl Spencer has told the BBC the Duke
OL,8,Fand Duchess of Sussex's treatment at
OL,9,Fthe hands of the media has "echoes" of
OL,10,Fwhat happened to his sister Diana,
OL,11,FPrincess of Wales.
OL,13,FHe described press coverage of Prince
OL,14,FHarry and Meghan as a "cancerous
OL,15,Finfluence in their life" and said it
OL,16,Fwould be "beholden on people to learn
OL,17,Ffrom Diana's example".
OL,19,FThe Sussexes, who recently returned to
OL,20,Fthe UK from California six years after
OL,21,Fstepping back from royal duties, have
OL,22,Fbeen repeatedly critical of the media.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
