OL,3,AHomes evacuated over fire-damaged hotel
OL,4,Asafety fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of 90 people were relocated
OL,7,Ffrom Pavilion Court in Marine Terrace
OL,8,Ffollowing concerns raised by safety
OL,9,Finspectors, Folkestone & Hythe District
OL,10,FCouncil said.
OL,12,FKent Police said that the blaze was
OL,13,Fbeing treated as suspicious and has
OL,14,Fappealed for witnesses.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
