OL,3,AEd Davey calls for immediate 10p cut to
OL,4,Afuel duty
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Lib Dems claim cutting 10p from
OL,7,Ffuel duty now would mean fuel would
OL,8,Fdrop by 12p per litre at the pump.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
